  - image cropping
  - image tiling
  - tile merging
  - Python
abstract: TiffCropper is a standalone Windows application for working with large digital pathology and microscopy images. It supports ROI cropping, fixed-size tiling, row/column-based image division, and reconstruction of tiled images, with support for TIFF, pyramidal TIFF, OME-TIFF, SVS, NDPI, MRXS, JPEG and PNG inputs.
